{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと50回で400回更新かあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださって\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントもちゃんと読んでるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近内容が薄い気がするけど、\nそれでもコメントしてくださって\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネックレス完成したー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーロメンンンティッック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいろいろ作ってみよっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな教科は何かな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本史！世界史！\n別に得意じゃないが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段暇な時なにしてるのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、\n掃除したり漫画読んだり\n物作ったり料理研究したり\n寝たり踊ったり\n出かけたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ...\nまりっか忙しいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか型ウイルスに感染して\nしまったんですがどうしたら\n治りますかあ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか新しいのが増えてるぞ笑\nそれに関してはまだ詳しくないな！\nどんな症状が出るんだい？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寿司で好きなネタは？\n何皿くらい食べるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回転寿司に行ったらかならず\nたまごと炙りサーモン食べるよ。\n貝類以外はいろいろ食べるよ:D\n数えてない...7皿くらい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ヶ月くらいの長い休みが\nあったら何がしたい？\nどこにいきたい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこに行くって言われたら\n海外行きたい！ってなるけど\nお金がないから行けない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく大阪行って友達と遊ぶかな～\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ね、神様はじめました\n読んでるの。3巻まで読んだの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"主人公の奈々生と誕生日一緒だった！\n2月20日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漢字違いだけど奈々未も一緒だ！わお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いなあ、アニメも見よう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆる巻きまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/25/2170636/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日土曜日なのか！\nそうなのか...！何をしようかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}